<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψί̆-γονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>late-born</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί σευ ἄλλος ὀνήσεται ὀψίγονός περ</span>”
				<i>;</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				30.6
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψιγόνων
			ἀνθρώπων</span> of men <i>after-born</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.353
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.302
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a
			son, <i>late-born, born in one's old age,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				165
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>; <i>born late in the season</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔριφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					4.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>later-born</i>, i.e. <i>younger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				361
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.3
			</span></i>; <i>young</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>late in spawning</i>, of the needle-fish, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				571a2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
